# Kishla Trawlers: Bot2's Lightning Bolt kills Bot1's Ornithopter on turn 2 (the Bolt goes to Bot2's graveyard, not Bot1's). On turn 3
# Bot1 casts Kishla Trawlers and exiles the Ornithopter, but "your graveyard" has no instant or sorcery card to target, so the
# reflexive trigger (CR 603.12) is removed from the stack for want of a target (CR 603.3d) and nothing returns.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Black Lotus
Ornithopter
Kishla Trawlers
Island x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Island x18

